The sources/*.go.txt files retain exact upstream case literal bytes.
The scenarios/*.json files are modified PostgreSQL ports. Changes include
typed native VC operations, explicit commit bindings, PostgreSQL identity
columns, text result values, and SQLSTATE assertions. Per-case changes and
source-to-step mappings are documented in ports.json.
